            "title": "Jim Cramer Says IES Holdings is \u201cGoing Higher Because it is Data Center\u201d",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "IES Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ:IESC) is one of the stocks in focus in Jim Cramer\u2019s latest lightning round. A caller asked for Cramer\u2019s thoughts on the stock during the lightning round, and he commented: \u201cI know that electrical contractor, that again, is going higher because it is data center. Do you see the pattern, everybody?\u201d IES [\u2026]",
